# NestJS Architecture

## ESM specifiers
This app is `"type": "module"`. Local imports **must** use `.js` specifiers (`./health.module.js`).

## Shared HTTP setup
CORS, global `/api` prefix, and `ValidationPipe` live in `src/configure-app.ts`. `main.ts` and e2e tests both call `configureApp(app)`. Do not duplicate bootstrap in tests.

## One module per concern
Feature modules: `auth`, `vaults`, `items`, `folders`, `templates`, `shares`. DTOs use `class-validator`. Controllers stay thin.

## Prisma
- Schema: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Client output: `src/generated/prisma` (gitignored).
- `PrismaService` / `PrismaModule` in `src/prisma/`.
- Do **not** import `PrismaModule` into `AppModule` until the first `prisma migrate dev` has run.
- Pin Prisma CLI to 7.9.x.

## No plaintext vault data
Store `Bytes` ciphertext, nonces, wrapped keys, and KDF params only. Do not decrypt item payloads on the server.

## Config
Read env through `ConfigModule` / `ConfigService`. Do not scatter `process.env` in controllers.
